\f1\i0 ," Eloise said mildly, but her eyes were watchful, \'93havebeen advancing human capability."\
As Sarah swept from the room, only Chip caught the dangerous gleam in her eye\'97not just anger, but calculation.\
Outside, Sarah paused at the elevator, her mind racing through contingencies. If Eloise wanted weapons, she'd get weapons\'97just not the ones she expected. Project Kebab had just become Project Chessboard, and Sarah intended to be several moves ahead.
